  "description": "Standalone serialization and encoding nodes for FluxFlow: JSON parse/stringify, text encode/decode, and base64 encode/decode, each a blockified converter (request in, result out) with broadcast output/error/event ports. No engine required.",
  "id": "FluxFlow.Components.Serialization",
