  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Rebuilt as standalone nodes over the FluxFlow.Nodes kit: each node is `new`ed with its options and processes FlowMessage envelopes — request in, converted result broadcast out (carrying the correlation id), per-message failures on the error port, success/failure notes on the event port. The engine factory, module, registration, design-metadata, and definition-based options reader are removed; the node depends only on FluxFlow.Nodes and runs without the engine.",
